  <item>
    <title>28.《去有风的地方》治愈到你了吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63ba9d5992f7bae63bec184b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63ba9d5992f7bae63bec184b</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 08 Jan 2023 10:39:21 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>刘亦菲和李现的新剧《去有风的地方》热播，以清新治愈的画风俘获了一大批向往“桃花源”的观众，该剧更是被网友称为“辞职宣传片”。但稍显平缓的叙事节奏也令习惯了紧凑快速观剧习惯的观众产生了不适。具体表现如何，大家一听节目便知。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>姜悦</span></p><span></span><p><span>潘潘</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间线】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">2:00</a>叙事节奏为何有人爱有人厌？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="320">5:20</a>云苗村的生活带给观众“去云南猫三个月”的想法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a> 细节和演技拿捏人心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="890">14:50</a> 谢之遥一角的优点与缺陷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1240">20:40</a> 剧集未出圈平台该背锅吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1540">25:40</a> 八集之后谈恋爱也许会迎来观剧小高潮</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1620">27:00</a> 豆瓣开分预测</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1720">28:40</a> 耐人寻味的小细节</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期节目使用的音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头曲：去有风的地方-郁可唯</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：摇篮谣-斯斯与帆</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lqWDL6RpNe904SfMEXLujr6gwCQJ.m4a" length="47277018" type="audio/mp4"/>
